ter_fd, 8192)\n        print(f\'PW=[{pw}] After show run:\', repr(resp))\n        \n        os.close(master_fd)\n        os.waitpid(pid, 0)\n        print()\n" 2>&1', 'description': 'Test different enable passwords via PTY', 'timeout': 25000}; start
